處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father-ws1501803","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-053","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001:m0000"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001:m0000","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete-ws1501803"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:source_review34-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"f84_da6_42a_AAAA","source_quote":"　　孔琇之，會稽山陰人也。祖季恭，光祿大夫，父靈運，著作郎。","reading":"孔琇之祖季恭即孔靖，父靈運。原稱及既有局部祖孫資料同時保留。","note":"孔琇之祖季恭即孔靖，父靈運。原稱及既有局部祖孫資料同時保留。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p034","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":30,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete-ws1501803"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:source_review35-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"f84_da6_42a_AAAA","source_quote":"　　琇之初爲國子生，舉孝廉。除衞軍行參軍，員外郎，尚書三公郎。出爲烏程令，有吏能。還遷通直郎，補吳令。有小兒年十歲，偷刈隣家稻一束，琇之付獄治罪，或諫之，琇之曰：「十歲便能爲盜，長大何所不爲？」縣中皆震肅。","reading":"小兒十歲是訟案中的當事人，非孔琇之年齡。","note":"小兒十歲是訟案中的當事人，非孔琇之年齡。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p035","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":103,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete-ws1501803"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:source_review36-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"f84_da6_42a_AAAA","source_quote":"　　遷尚書左丞，又以職事知名。轉前軍將軍，兼少府。遷驍騎將軍，少府如故。出爲寧朔將軍、高宗冠軍征虜長史、江夏內史。還爲正員常侍，兼左民尚書、廷尉卿。出爲臨海太守，在任清約，罷郡還，獻乾薑二十斤，世祖嫌少，及知琇之清，乃歎息。除武陵王前軍長史，未拜，仍出爲輔國將軍，監吳興郡，尋拜太守，治稱清嚴。","reading":"臨海任清，乾薑獻量及世祖評議留原。武陵前軍長史未拜。","note":"臨海任清，乾薑獻量及世祖評議留原。武陵前軍長史未拜。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p036","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":147,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete-ws1501803"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:source_review37-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"f84_da6_42a_AAAA","source_quote":"　　高宗輔政，防制諸蕃，致密旨於上佐。隆昌元年，遷琇之爲寧朔將軍、晉熙王冠軍長史，行郢州事，江夏內史。琇之辭，不許。未拜，卒。","reading":"隆昌元年遷晉熙王冠軍長史等，報辭不許，未拜即卒。","note":"隆昌元年遷晉熙王冠軍長史等，報辭不許，未拜即卒。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p037","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":63,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete-ws1501803"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-qi049-xiuzhi-lingyun","subject_person_id":"f84_da6_42a_AAAA","object_person_id":"f84_da6_42a_AAA","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父靈運","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-053","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father","source_id":"s-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father-ws1501803","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001","quote":"孔琇之，會稽山陰人也。祖季恭，光祿大夫，父靈運，著作郎。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-05